### Join employee
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeName": "John Doe"
}

### List employees
GET http://localhost:8080/api/employees

### Announce course
POST http://localhost:8080/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "JAVAX-DDD",
  "title": "Data Driven Design",
  "limit": 7
}

